her but softer.\u{1}每个像素混合多少相邻图像。数值越大越平滑，但也越柔。\u{1}How sharp a frame must be to win over the bloomed one. Higher is stricter; too high rejects genuinely sharp detail.\u{1}一张图像需要多锐利才能胜过出现光晕的那张。数值越高越严格；过高会剔除真正锐利的细节。\u{1}How the viewpoint moves. Rocking sweeps side to side (or up and down); Circle orbits, which reads most strongly 3D — no structure can hide parallel to the motion.\u{1}视点的移动方式。摇摆是左右（或上下）扫动；圆周是环绕运动，立体感最强 — 没有任何结构能与运动方向平行而隐藏。\u{1}Hyperfocal Help\u{1}Hyperfocal 帮助\u{1}Hyperfocal doesn’t have permission to read this project’s images\u{1}Hyperfocal 没有权限读取此项目的图像\u{1}Hyperfocal projects (*.hyperfocal)\u{1}Hyperfocal 项目 (*.hyperfocal)\u{1}Include %1\u{1}包含%1\u{1}Include %1 in Fuse Enabled Stacks\u{1}将%1纳入“合成已启用的堆栈”\u{1}Include %@\u{1}包含%@\u{1}Include %@ in Fuse Enabled Stacks\u{1}将%@纳入“合成已启用的堆栈”\u{1}Include this stack in Fuse Enabled Stacks; frame checkboxes are unaffected.\u{1}将此堆栈纳入“合成已启用的堆栈”；不影响各图像的复选框。\u{1}Input\u{1}输入\u{1}JPEG\u{1}JPEG\u{1}Keep All Frames\u{1}保留所有图像\u{1}Keeps aligned frames in a temporary file during depth fusion so the stack isn't decoded twice (identical results, faster — the file needs about 0.7 GB of free disk per 45-megapixel frame and is removed when fusing finishes). Hyperfocal warns before fusing if it won't fit; turn off to never use the disk.\u{1}在深度合成期间将已对齐图像保存在临时文件中，避免堆栈被解码两次（结果完全相同且更快 — 每张 4500 万像素图像约需 0.7 GB 可用磁盘空间，合成完成后文件即被删除）。若空间不足，Hyperfocal 会在合成前警告；关闭后将完全不使用磁盘。\u{1}Linear Display P3\u{1}线性 Display P3\u{1}Loading\u{1}载入\u{1}Loading source…\u{1}正在载入来源…\u{1}Low disk space\u{1}磁盘空间不足\u{1}MP4 (H.264)\u{1}MP4（H.264）\u{1}MP4 plays once unless the player is told to loop (no video format carries a loop flag players honor). GIF loops forever everywhere, at the cost of larger files and reduced colors.\u{1}除非播放器设置了循环，MP4 只播放一次（没有任何视频格式带有播放器会遵守的循环标志）。GIF 在任何地方都无限循环，代价是文件更大、颜色更少。\u{1}Matching gradients\u{1}正在匹配梯度\u{1}Measures each frame's overall brightness and corrects shot-to-shot exposure flicker (shutter or lighting variation) before blending, so it can't imprint brightness patches on the result.\u{1}测量每张图像的整体亮度，并在混合前校正逐张曝光闪烁（快门或光照变化），使其无法在结果上留下亮度斑块。\u{1}Median radius\u{1}中值半径\u{1}Medium\u{1}中等\u{1}New Project\u{1}新建项目\u{1}New Project…\u{1}新建项目…\u{1}No alignment yet — fuse the stack (with alignment on) first.\u{1}尚未对齐 — 请先（开启对齐）合成堆栈。\u{1}No output yet\u{1}暂无输出\u{1}No usable GPU found — fusing runs on the CPU.\u{1}未找到可用的 GPU — 合成将在 CPU 上运行。\u{1}Noise floor\u{1}噪声阈值\u{1}None\u{1}无\u{1}Not Now\u{1}以后再说\u{1}Not enough usable frames to fuse — a stack needs at least 2 after bad frames are excluded. Re-check excluded frames in the Stack list to opt them back in.\u{1}可用于合成的图像不足 — 排除有问题的图像后，堆栈至少需要 2 张。在堆栈列表中重新勾选被排除的图像即可重新纳入。\u{1}One Stack per Folder\u{1}每个文件夹一个堆栈\u{1}One full cycle of the motion; the file loops seamlessly.\u{1}运动的一个完整周期；文件无缝循环。\u{1}Open Download Page\u{1}打开下载页面\u{1}Open Folder…\u{1}打开文件夹…\u{1}Open Project\u{1}打开项目\u{1}Open Project…\u{1}打开项目…\u{1}Open a different project?\u{1}要打开其他项目吗？\u{1}Open a project\u{1}打开项目\u{1}Order frames by capture time\u{1}按拍摄时间排序图像\u{1}Original\u{1}原始比例\u{1}Output\u{1}输出\u{1}Overall image brightness\u{1}图像整体亮度\u{1}Overall image contrast\u{1}图像整体对比度\u{1}PMax Result\u{1}PMax 结果\u{1}PMax blend layer\u{1}PMax 混合图层\u{1}PNG (16-bit)\u{1}PNG（16 位）\u{1}Path:\u{1}路径：\u{1}Performance\u{1}性能\u{1}Pixels below this sharpness are treated as featureless and take their depth from neighbors. Raise it until glow halos disappear; stop before real detail blurs.\u{1}低于此锐度的像素被视为无特征，其深度取自相邻像素。调高直到辉光光晕消失；在真实细节变模糊之前停止。\u{1}Preparing the %@ result…\u{1}正在准备 %@ 结果…\u{1}Press “Fuse Stack”\u{1}点按“合成堆栈”\u{1}ProPhoto RGB\u{1}ProPhoto RGB\u{1}Project\u{1}项目\u{1}Quit\u{1}退出\u{1}Radius used to judge sharpness at each pixel. Larger is steadier on smooth surfaces; smaller resolves finer detail.\u{1}用于判断每个像素锐度的半径。较大时在平滑表面上更稳定；较小时能分辨更精细的细节。\u{1}Reading frames\u{1}正在读取图像\u{1}Redo\u{1}重做\u{1}Redo %@\u{1}重做%@\u{1}Register every frame to its neighbor before fusing (focus breathing, drift, rotation). Turn off only for stacks that are already pixel-aligned, e.g. re-exports from another tool.\u{1}合成前将每张图像与相邻图像配准（焦点呼吸、漂移、旋转）。仅对已像素级对齐的堆栈关闭，例如从其他工具重新导出的堆栈。\u{1}Regularizing depth map\u{1}正在正则化深度图\u{1}Rendering\u{1}正在渲染\u{1}Reset\u{1}重置\u{1}Restoring project…\u{1}正在恢复项目…\u{1}Result\u{1}结果\u{1}Retouch from\u{1}修饰来源\u{1}Retouched Depth — drag to paint from source\u{1}修饰后的深度 — 拖动以从来源绘制\u{1}Retouched Output — drag to paint from source\u{1}修饰后的输出 — 拖动以从来源绘制\u{1}Retouching\u{1}修饰\u{1}Revert All\u{1}全部还原\u{1}Rock left–right\u{1}左右摇摆\u{1}Rock up–down\u{1}上下摇摆\u{1}Rocking animations export as GIF on this platform — choose a .gif filename.\u{1}在此平台上，摇摆动画将导出为 GIF，请选择 .gif 文件名。\u{1}Save Project\u{1}存储项目\u{1}Save Project As…\u{1}项目存储为…\u{1}Save project\u{1}存储项目\u{1}Scanning frames…\u{1}正在扫描图像…\u{1}Scanning frames… %1$lld of %2$lld\u{1}正在扫描图像… %2$lld 张中的 %1$lld 张\u{1}Select a frame in the Stack list\u{1}在堆栈列表中选择一张图像\u{1}Separate Stacks\u{1}独立堆栈\u{1}Settings\u{1}设置\u{1}Settings…\u{1}设置…\u{1}Shadows\u{1}阴影\u{1}Sharpness σ\u{1}锐度 σ\u{1}Skip\u{1}跳过\u{1}Softness\u{1}柔和度\u{1}Some stacks didn't fuse\u{1}部分堆栈未能合成\u{1}Sorts each stack's frames by EXIF capture time when loading (filename order breaks when the camera's file counter rolls over mid-stack). Frames without timestamps fall back to filename order. Turn off to always order by filename.\u{1}载入时按 EXIF 拍摄时间排序每个堆栈的图像（相机文件计数器在堆栈中途归零时，文件名顺序会出错）。没有时间戳的图像回退到文件名顺序。关闭后始终按文件名排序。\u{1}Source Image\u{1}源图像\u{1}Source: %1   ↑/↓ cycle · space picks sharpest\u{1}来源：%1   ↑/↓ 切换 · 空格选择最清晰的图像\u{1}Source: %@  ↑/↓ cycle · space picks sharpest\u{1}来源：%@  ↑/↓ 切换 · 空格选取最清晰\u{1}Stack\u{1}堆栈\u{1}Stack %1\u{1}堆栈%1\u{1}Stack %@\u{1}堆栈%@\u{1}Stack %lld of %lld · \u{1}堆栈 %1$lld / %2$lld · \u{1}Stack section\u{1}堆栈部分\u{1}Stacks\u{1}堆栈\u{1}Start Retouching\u{1}开始修饰\u{1}Start a new project to begin\u{1}新建项目以开始\u{1}Start a new project?\u{1}要新建项目吗？\u{1}Starting…\u{1}正在开始…\u{1}Stop building the PMax layer and go back to the previous brush source. Selecting PMax Result again restarts the build.\u{1}停止生成 PMax 图层并返回上一个画笔来源。再次选择 PMax 结果会重新开始生成。\u{1}Strength:\u{1}强度：\u{1}Strengths: Accurate color. Cleaner handling of highlights. Depth map is necessary for certain features.\n\nWeaknesses: Can struggle with overlapping or translucent details.\u{1}优势：色彩准确。高光处理更干净。某些功能需要深度图。\n\n劣势：处理重叠或半透明的细节时可能表现欠佳。\u{1}Strengths: Can do a better job with overlapping or translucent details.\n\nWeaknesses: Can alter colors and cause highlights to bloom.\u{1}优势：能更好地处理重叠或半透明的细节。\n\n劣势：可能改变色彩，并使高光产生光晕。\u{1}Stroke\u{1}笔画\u{1}Strong\u{1}强烈\u{1}Subtle\u{1}轻微\u{1}Suppresses highlight bloom by gating the coarsest pyramid levels. 0 turns it off; higher cuts more bloom.\u{1}通过控制最粗糙的金字塔层级来抑制高光光晕。0 表示关闭；数值越高，去除的光晕越多。\u{1}Swap Crop Orientation\u{1}切换裁剪方向\u{1}Swap the crop between landscape and portrait (X).\u{1}在横向与纵向之间切换裁剪（X）。\u{1}TIFF (16-bit)\u{1}TIFF（16 位）\u{1}That folder doesn’t contain the project’s images\u{1}该文件夹不包含此项目的图像\u{1}The frames couldn't be aligned with each other. Check that the folder holds a single focus stack shot from a steady camera — frames from different scenes or camera positions can't line up.\u{1}图像之间无法对齐。请确认此文件夹只包含一个用稳定相机拍摄的堆栈 — 来自不同场景或不同机位的图像无法对齐。\u{1}The frames differ in size (%lld×%lld vs %lld×%lld) — every frame in a stack must have the same resolution. This folder may mix images from different sources.\u{1}图像尺寸不一致（%lld×%lld 与 %lld×%lld）— 堆栈中的所有图像必须具有相同分辨率。此文件夹可能混杂了来自不同来源的图像。\u{1}The images are in “%@”. Choose that folder, or any folder that contains it.\u{1}图像位于“%@”。请选择该文件夹或包含它的任意文件夹。\u{1}The pipeline works in Display P3. sRGB is the safe default for sharing; Display P3 keeps the full working gamut; ProPhoto suits further heavy editing. DNG always carries the full P3 gamut as linear raw.\u{1}处理管线在 Display P3 中工作。sRGB 是分享的稳妥默认；Display P3 保留完整工作色域；ProPhoto 适合后续深度编辑。DNG 始终以线性原始格式携带完整 P3 色域。\u{1}The selected frames are written to this folder, aligned to the fused canvas.\u{1}所选图像将写入此文件夹，并与合成画布对齐。\u{1}These frames carry no capture times, so they fuse in filename order. Make sure filenames follow focus order.\u{1}这些图像没有拍摄时间，因此按文件名顺序合成。请确保文件名遵循对焦顺序。\u{1}Third-Party Notices\u{1}第三方声明\u{1}This image cannot be previewed\u{1}无法预览此图像\u{1}Tone\u{1}色调\u{1}Tone Adjustment\u{1}色调调整\u{1}Try Again\u{1}重试\u{1}Undo\u{1}撤销\u{1}Undo %@\u{1}撤销%@\u{1}Unsaved data will be lost.\u{1}未存储的数据将丢失。\u{1}Use GPU\u{1}使用 GPU\u{1}Version %1 (%2)\u{1}版本 %1 (%2)\u{1}Version %@ (%@)\u{1}版本 %@ (%@)\u{1}View\u{1}视图\u{1}Waiting for the previous fusion to stop…\u{1}正在等待上一次合成停止…\u{1}What the brush paints from. Source Image: any aligned frame (↑/↓ to pick, space for the sharpest). PMax Result: keeps both sides where depths overlap. DMap Result: the original fusion — use it to erase a stroke without undoing edits made after it.\u{1}画笔的绘制来源。源图像：任意已对齐的图像（↑/↓ 选择，空格键选最锐利的一张）。PMax 结果：在深度重叠处保留两侧。DMap 结果：原始合成结果 — 可用它擦除某一笔而不撤销之后的编辑。\u{1}Whites\u{1}白色\u{1}Zoom In\u{1}放大\u{1}Zoom Out\u{1}缩小\u{1}Zoom in\u{1}放大\u{1}Zoom level\u{1}缩放级别\u{1}Zoom out\u{1}缩小\u{1}Zoom to Fit\u{1}缩放以适合窗口\u{1}Zoom:\u{1}缩放：\u{1}alignment failed\u{1}对齐失败\u{1}macOS grants access folder by folder, and the permission this project saved couldn’t be restored. Grant access to %@ to load the images — saving the project afterward keeps the access for next time. Fused results are intact either way.\u{1}macOS 按文件夹授予访问权限，而此项目存储的权限无法恢复。请允许访问%@以载入图像 — 之后存储项目即可在下次保留该权限。无论如何，已合成的结果都完好无损。\u{1}misaligned (%.1f× the stack's typical frame difference)\u{1}未对齐（为堆栈典型帧差的 %.1f 倍）\u{1}project restore failed: %@\u{1}项目恢复失败：%@\u{1}sRGB\u{1}sRGB\u{1}the folder “%@”\u{1}文件夹“%@”\u{1}~%lld min left\u{1}剩余约 %lld 分钟\u{1}~%llds left\u{1}剩余约 %lld 秒\u{1}“%@” looks like %lld separate stacks\u{1}“%1$@”看起来像 %2$lld 个独立堆栈\u{1}↑/↓ cycle source frames · space picks the sharpest frame for the brush region · p PMax result · r eraser · Alt-scroll or [ ] resize the brush · scroll/pinch to navigate\u{1}↑/↓ 切换源图像 · 空格键选取画笔区域最清晰的图像 · p PMax 结果 · r 擦除 · Alt-滚动或 [ ] 调整画笔大小 · 滚动/捏合以导航\u{1}↑/↓ cycle source frames · space picks the 